@x
        No secret configuration is needed. When you run Codex, <code>sbx</code>
        opens the OpenAI sign-in flow on your host before creating the sandbox.
@y
        No secret configuration is needed. When you run Codex, <code>sbx</code>
        opens the OpenAI sign-in flow on your host before creating the sandbox.
@z

@x
        No secret configuration is needed. After Claude Code starts in the
        sandbox, enter <code>/login</code> and sign in with your Claude account.
@y
        No secret configuration is needed. After Claude Code starts in the
        sandbox, enter <code>/login</code> and sign in with your Claude account.
@z

@x
          Store your {{ $choice.provider }} API key in the host credential
          store. The command prompts for the key without displaying it:
